AccountV3Interop
├── given an active, fully initialized account
│   ├── valid SPEND quorum: return magic, no nonce/write/log, any caller
│   ├── change account, chain, generation, version or app hash: invalid
│   ├── shared signers across accounts: no signature replay
│   ├── raw owner, execution or admin digest: no cross-purpose authorization
│   ├── missing/duplicate/non-SPEND/oversized/malformed votes: fail closed
│   ├── application nonce/domain/deadline: consumer enforces them, not the wallet
│   ├── callback during signed CALL: read-only approval remains usable
│   ├── actual WebAuthn assertion: approve using current active policy
│   └── trace: no SSTORE/TSTORE/LOG/TIMESTAMP/BLOCKNUMBER, fixed library observed
├── given implementation or creation pending: no application authority
├── given a policy transition
│   ├── prepared: old policy remains authoritative
│   ├── committed: old signatures invalid, even with updated envelope version
│   └── empty/unreachable policy never becomes active
├── given linked library code drift: fail closed
├── native/ERC721/ERC1155 single and batch receipts
│   └── authenticated direct CALL can transfer all received assets out
└── introspection
    ├── advertise only actual 165/1271/4337/5267/receiver interfaces
    └── domain matches signing digest, proxy address and current chain
